    "is_overridden": false,
    "content": "\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<style type=\"text/css\">\n\t\tbody {\n\t\t\tfont-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n\t\t\tfont-size: 14px;\n\t\t\tcolor: #333333;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\th1 {\n\t\t\tfont-size: 24px;\n\t\t\tfont-weight: bold;\n\t\t\tmargin: 0 0 20px;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tp {\n\t\t\tmargin: 0 0 10px;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\tstrong {\n\t\t\tfont-weight: bold;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\t.signature {\n\t\t\tfont-style: italic;\n\t\t\tcolor: #999999;\n\t\t\tmargin-top: 20px;\n\t\t\tborder-top: 1px solid #cccccc;\n\t\t\tpadding-top: 10px;\n\t\t}\n\t</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\t<h1>Invoice Created</h1>\n\t<p>Hello {{ c.first_name|default('') }} {{ c.last_name|default('') }},</p>\n\t<p>This is to notify that invoice {{ invoice.id|default('') }} was generated on {{ invoice.created_at|default('')|format_date }}.</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>Amount Due:</strong> {{ invoice.total|default(0)|format_currency(invoice.currency|default(default_currency)) }}</li>\n        <li><strong>Due Date:</strong>  {{ invoice.due_at|default('')|format_date }}</li>\n        {% if invoice.orders|default([])|length > 0 %}\n            {% for order in invoice.orders|default([]) %}\n                <li><strong>Order ID:</strong> #{{ order.id }}</li>\n                {% if order.product_name %}\n                    <li><strong>Product:</strong> {{ order.product_name }}</li>\n                {% endif %}\n                {% if order.expires_at %}\n                    <li><strong>Renewal Date:</strong> {{ order.expires_at|format_date }}</li>\n                {% endif %}\n            {% endfor %}\n        {% endif %}\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>You may view and pay the invoice <a href='{{ \"invoice/#{invoice.hash|default('')}\"|url(area: 'client') }}' target=\"_blank\">here.</a></p>\n    <p>You can also <a href=\"{{ \"invoice/pdf/#{invoice.hash|default('')}\"|url(area: 'client') }}\" target=\"_blank\">download the invoice as a PDF</a>, <a href=\"{{ 'login'|url(query: { 'email': c.email|default('') }, area: 'client') }}\" target=\"_blank\">login</a>, or <a href=\"{{ 'client/profile'|url(area: 'client') }}\" target=\"_blank\">edit your profile.</a></p>\n\n\t<div class=\"signature\">{{ guest.system_email.signature }}</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
